WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.394 --> 00:00:04.377
Unit fourteen. Healthy Weight and Metabolism!

2
00:00:05.307 --> 00:00:10.650
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.840
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:19.129
Today we learn about Healthy Weight and Metabolism. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.187 --> 00:00:24.554
Metabolism. Say it with me. Metabolism!

6
00:00:28.065 --> 00:00:32.732
Energy balance. Say it with me. Energy balance!

7
00:00:36.256 --> 00:00:41.556
BMI. Say it with me. BMI!

8
00:00:45.058 --> 00:00:48.975
Muscle. Say it with me. Muscle!

9
00:00:52.453 --> 00:00:55.920
Diet. Say it with me. Diet!

10
00:00:59.408 --> 00:01:03.275
Activity. Say it with me. Activity!

11
00:01:06.831 --> 00:01:11.014
Body image. Say it with me. Body image!

12
00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:18.147
Health. Say it with me. Health!

13
00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:34.750
Metabolism turns food into energy. Energy balance depends on diet and activity. BMI is only one measure — muscle, fitness, and a healthy body image also matter for health.

14
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:38.646
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:40.047 --> 00:01:45.407
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:45.457 --> 00:01:46.607
BMI!

17
00:01:48.165 --> 00:01:53.412
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:53.462 --> 00:01:54.645
Body image!

19
00:01:55.763 --> 00:02:03.370
Did you know? Muscle weighs more than fat for the same size, so BMI can be misleading for athletes!

20
00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:05.896
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:06.685 --> 00:02:15.332
Think and answer. Why is BMI not the full picture of health?

22
00:02:15.382 --> 00:02:16.573
Great answer!

23
00:02:17.611 --> 00:02:23.452
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:23.502 --> 00:02:26.559
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

